From d0987688fea4ab924b4921a72009e01c4e6343da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CoreyKatzburg <64795827+CoreyKatzburg@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 13:15:33 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 14/17] Revert "Add rtx.captureAllInstances (default off)"

This reverts commit 0c13881. The fix rested on a wrong premise: no draw in this game has more than one instance (see the previous revert: instancedCapturedDraws 0 on all 6,227 frames of run 20261116-130630-settings 02_on with the option True). Even off, the change made every captured vertex shader read InstanceIndex; the stock capture path is restored. The telemetry fields from cb7d3b6 and the header from c46a50f stay.
